category: Libs
requires: cygwin libgfortran5 liblapack0 libmctc-lib0 libnumsa0
sdesc: "Extended conductor-like polarizable continuum solvation model (runtime)"
ldesc: "This is an fully open source solvation model, based on the original conductor
like screening model for realistic solvation (COSMO-RS) model by Klamt et al.
in combination with the universal solvation model based on solute electron
density (SMD) by Marenich, Cramer and Truhlar."
external-source: cpx

